      "raw": "Famously, Ra is quoted as saying \"as the size of an explosion increases, the number of social situations it cannot solve approaches zero.\" *whisper whisper whisper* \"And that would be bad.\"\n\nHaka needing immortality to exit timeline 1 through mistgates is a definite Retcon, very similar to how it's a plot point in Avengers Endgame that only Hulk can wear the Infinity Gauntlet, and even he loses that arm, when there was never any previous indication that the snap would cause a surge of energy in the arm that wore the gauntlet.  That definitely wasn't shown for Thanos at the end of IW.\n\nIf there were a Shazam deck for SOTM, which I have definitely thought about, then the only depiction of Billy would be on his incap side, where we see him trying to yell his name while Sivana is drowning him, and maybe one depiction in Sivana's deck where he's similarly being prevented from succeeding in Shazam stuff.\n\nDemiurge is a displacer beast?\n\nC&A share my preference for pie over cake.  Though I would clarify that it has to be good pie; a good pie is better than a good cake, but a mediocre cake is better than a mediocre pie.",
